ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Msv2GSI_O8oQ7kNvwFSprZw&_nc_oc=AdqcXqPzhwkr2KHCx_0Bh_lAHfseoTNVB_2ei-Mp8PvE17iQpK5bMuvaFoWXiC5b7HE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT1IhTEI1gAYzfbAFRv0zQQkL7Ks3se6G1KHqlnqCHiWg&oe=6AFF1246"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tjxcHZ_3_zkQ7kNvwHM6UJ1&_nc_oc=AdphmLVfi1dJ3bAVAX39zLcly__A6MmwvHgxvsJP3zGRXS-feY8ap4xmLkjN3C6VIlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSktJUALnzbDEGetfby59Kmj-3hbfbvoLG5wUsUrOCOwg&oe=6AFF32E0"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_SBzN37Y2SYQ7kNvwEt0Wv7&_nc_oc=Adq6laY8VN21Ya55R7czMC5RvM5EBBjyFxCXe44_bTJO5Hcn1A5VvtmMJTsr7g5SBOg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAjR3zkUnyyKCIdwr1jxcmh7mnZBxt5v2Lcp7PGivlmw&oe=6AFF1951"}, {